</style></head><body><div class="wrap">
<div class="hdr"><div><h1><em>&#x1F552;</em> Health History - <span id="stn"></span></h1><div class="meta" id="meta"></div></div><div class="gen" id="gen"></div></div>
<div class="datebar"><label>From</label><input type="date" id="dFrom"/><label>To</label><input type="date" id="dTo"/><span style="font-size:10.5px;color:var(--tx4)">Pick a device below, then Load Graph. Dates use the same range for graphs, records and the sensor timeline.</span></div>
